WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.875
A field relay is all that connects your forward teams to their supply base.

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:12.100
In this fictional exercise, attacks will arrive before the workshop is secure.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:18.150
Expand the economy, assemble a mixed defense, and keep the signal alive.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:24.500
Only then can you turn the defense into an assault on the opposing command post.
